# File Path: /frontend-js/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# Description: Minimal source/build context for the production frontend image.
# Main Features:
#   - Excludes secrets, task evidence and generated dependency/build output
#   - Includes only the source and lockfile needed for the image build

*
!Dockerfile
!nginx.conf
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!index.html
!vite.config.js
!public/
!public/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!src/
!src/**

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/plans/**
**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
